{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02775","headline":"赠益府裴录事 · 卢照邻","name":"赠益府裴录事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽忽岁云暮，相望限风烟。\n长歌欲对酒，危坐遂停弦。\n停弦变霜露，对酒怀朋故。\n朝看桂蟾晚，夜闻鸿雁度。\n鸿度何时还？桂晚不同攀。\n浮云映丹壑，明月满青山。\n青山云路深，丹壑月华临。\n耿耿离忧积，空令星鬓侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02775.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02775","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}